  "description": "The front bumper has built-in powerful 36W(2pcs) & 40W(2pcs) LED lights to ensure complete confidence in any nighttime adventure. This Front Bumper bolts onto the factory holes, no additional drilling or cutting is required. Strong D-ring mounts are welded both on the inside and outside.\nFeatures\nAdded Protection for You & Your Vehicle. A custom front bumper is made of heavy-duty steel, giving increased protection to the front end of your vehicle. These custom front bumpers won’t easily crumble in a collision.\nAnti-rust. OEDRO bumper made with a high-quality textured black powder coat and laser welding procedure, better prevent rust.\nRadiator Protection. The radiator is usually situated in the front of a vehicle and when a steel bumper is fitted it drastically improves the protection of this vital component.\nFeatures\nFits for 1987-2006 Jeep Wrangler TJ & YJ.\nNote: The shackle is not designed for towing and recovery, refer to the owner's manual for towing and rescue information. Overload is not included in after-sales service.",
